      "mergedPostDetails": "Same as https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1484-controller-models-now-appear-in-camera\n\nBut for the white tracker balls that you usually see when calibrating FBT.\n\nIn beta, the white tracker balls also appear when grabbing the camera (and maybe other items), and these tracker balls also appear in your Camera or Stream Cam. For some reason, they also take a while to disappear, so taking photos is really hard right now.\n\nUsing Index Controllers.",
